# Real-Time AI Shipment Chat Moderation

## Overview

An AI-powered real-time moderation system designed to analyze shipment chat messages as they are received and identify abusive, offensive, or threatening content.

The system processes each incoming message independently without waiting for the conversation to end, evaluates the content using AI, determines the violation status and severity level, and triggers the appropriate moderation action.

## Problem

Shipment conversations can contain inappropriate or abusive messages that require immediate intervention.

Manual monitoring is difficult to scale and may result in delayed responses or inconsistent moderation decisions.

## Solution

This workflow automates message-level moderation by analyzing each incoming chat message in real time and applying predefined moderation rules.

## Workflow

Webhook
→ Message Normalization
→ AI Moderation
→ Structured Output
→ Violation Decision
→ Sender Classification
→ Moderation Action

## Key Features

- Real-time message-level analysis
- AI-powered content moderation
- Violation detection
- Severity scoring
- Client and captain message handling
- Automated moderation actions
- Structured AI output
- API-based integration

## AI Decision

The AI evaluates each message and returns structured moderation data including:

- Violation status
- Severity score

The moderation logic is designed to avoid incorrectly flagging legitimate complaints, frustration, or negative feedback as abusive content.

## Technologies

- n8n
- OpenAI API
- Webhooks
- REST APIs
- Structured AI Output

## Business Impact

- Enables real-time moderation
- Reduces manual monitoring
- Standardizes moderation decisions
- Improves response time to inappropriate messages
- Supports scalable shipment communication operations

## Architecture

The workflow follows a real-time event-driven architecture where each incoming message is processed independently.

